---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

/**
 * Ported verbatim from the pre-Astro privacy.html — one of the hand-written pages, each
 * hitting a distinct high-intent search phrase with its own angle rather than being a reworded
 * copy of the others. The body copy below is unchanged; only internal links (now extensionless)
 * and asset paths (now absolute) were rewritten.
 */
const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "GSRTC Bus Tracker",
        "item": "https://gsrtc.shivrajsinh.in/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Privacy Policy",
        "item": "https://gsrtc.shivrajsinh.in/privacy"
      }
    ]
  }
];
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — gsrtc.shivrajsinh.in | GSRTC Bus Tracker"
  description="What this website collects, the cookies advertising places here, and how this site and the GSRTC Bus Tracker app each handle your data."
  path="privacy"
  lang="en"
  ogType="website"
  headerVariant="page"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap section narrow">

  <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
  <h1>What this website collects</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    This page is about <b>gsrtc.shivrajsinh.in</b> — the website you are reading now. The ST
    Tracker app at tracker.shivrajsinh.in is a different thing with a stricter policy of its own,
    and the difference matters, so it is set out below rather than glossed over.
  </p>

  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This website carries <b>advertising</b>, and advertising uses cookies.</li>
    <li>This website uses <b>Google Analytics</b> to count visits.</li>
    <li>The <b>app</b> is governed by its own separate privacy policy and records pseudonymous usage and location
      data; nothing on this page changes that.</li>
    <li>There are no accounts here, and nothing you type on this site is stored by us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Pages on this site show ads served by <b>Google AdSense</b>. Google and its partners use
    cookies and similar technologies to serve and measure those ads, which may include showing
    you ads based on your previous visits to this or other websites.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not receive, store or have access to anything Google collects for this purpose. We see
    only aggregate earnings and impression counts — never who saw what.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can turn off personalised advertising at
    <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google My Ad Center</a>,
    and opt out of third-party vendor cookies at
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">aboutads.info/choices</a>.
    Google's own explanation of how it uses data from sites that use its services is at
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    This site loads Google Analytics 4 to count page views, see which guides people arrive on
    from search, and measure whether a visitor opens the tracker or submits the landing-page
    search form. That is how the site is decided about — which pages to write, and which are not
    worth keeping. It sets cookies in your browser. The number plate, PNR, route, station and
    location that a visitor may use in the tracker are not sent to Analytics from this site.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site stores on your device</h2>
  <p>
    Two values, in your browser's local storage, both set by you and readable only by this site:
  </p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Key</th><th>What it is</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>st.landing.theme</code></td><td>Whether you chose light or dark</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>st.landing.lang</code></td><td>Whether you chose English or Gujarati</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p>Clearing your browser's site data removes both. Nothing is lost but the preference.</p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>
    Like any web server, this one records the address of each request, the time, the page asked
    for, and the browser's user-agent string. That is how faults get diagnosed and abuse gets
    noticed. These logs are not joined to the analytics or advertising data above.
  </p>

  <h2>How the app is different</h2>
  <p>
    <b>tracker.shivrajsinh.in — the app — has its own separate privacy policy.</b> It has no accounts, but it
    records pseudonymous usage and location data to improve service coverage. Its own privacy
    policy, including the exact data and retention period, is published at
    <a href="https://tracker.shivrajsinh.in/privacy.html" rel="noopener">tracker.shivrajsinh.in/privacy.html</a>
    and is the one that governs everything you do inside the app.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site exists to help people find the app from a search engine. Both the landing site and
    the app have their own separate privacy policies covering their respective data practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect anything from
    them.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If what this site collects changes, this page changes with it. It is the page to check, and
    it is dated below rather than left vague.
  </p>
  <p class="hint">Last updated 28 August 2026.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about anything here: <a href="https://shivrajsinh.in" rel="me">shivrajsinh.in</a>.
  </p>

</main>
</Base>
